  "query_preview": "/SATURDAY THROUGH THURSDAY/...\nIssued at 222 PM CDT Thu Aug 20 2026\n \nAnother embedded shortwave will move across Iowa late Sunday \nevening into Monday, slowing from model solutions 24 hours ago. \nThe upcoming work week looks to remain active with embedded \nshortwaves continuing to ride along the western US ridge with \nnorthwest flow across Iowa. A more robust system looks to move \nacross the area on Tuesday and will be the next opportunity for \nmore organized convection. At this time range differences remain\nwith the GFS favoring a southerly track over the Euro northerly\ntrack.",
